OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FEarly sunny spells gradually
OL,6,Fgiving way to thicker cloud and rain
OL,7,For showers, but this clearing during
OL,8,Fthe afternoon. Becoming dry and bright
OL,9,Fwith sunny spells later in the
OL,10,Fafternoon. Warm, perhaps very warm in
OL,11,FSuffolk and Essex.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FEarly evening sunny spells
OL,14,Fgiving way to wet conditions this
OL,15,Fevening. Rain, occasionally heavy,
OL,16,Fmoving southeastwards overnight.
OL,17,FBecoming breezy, mainly on coasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
