OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FEarly rain, occasionally
OL,6,Fheavy, clearing away during the
OL,7,Fmorning. Then mostly dry with sunny
OL,8,Fspells in the afternoon. Wind
OL,9,Fstrengthening, especially later on
OL,10,Fnortheast coasts.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FSunny
OL,13,Fspells and isolated mainly coastal
OL,14,Fshowers Wednesday, wind easing. Mostly
OL,15,Fdry Thursday, with hazy sunshine.
OL,16,FEarly rain and breeze Friday clearing
OL,17,Flater. Temperatures around average for
OL,18,Fearly September.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
